{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Guardian Demon</strong>\u00a0is an action packed arcade style game. Utilizing simple mouse controls making it easy for anyone to pick up and play but with enough depth to encourage honing your skills.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Love some good old fashion carnage? Well you've got your work cut out for you. Take on the role of a demonic sword and protect the feeble peasant Myson from the endless onslaught of orcs out for blood! Gather blood from each kill to build up your blood meter and unleash your ultimate form.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Attack &amp; Defend</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Guard Myson from magic and arrows with your impenetrable shield form and strike back with your sharp and deadly sword form. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4150110/extras/bfaf17a1b4c0861cdaf2fc348244708a.poster.avif?t=1769336098\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4150110/extras/bfaf17a1b4c0861cdaf2fc348244708a.webm?t=1769336098\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4150110/extras/bfaf17a1b4c0861cdaf2fc348244708a.mp4?t=1769336098\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Upgrades</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enhance the power of the Demon Sword with various magical upgrades</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4150110/extras/be9fd66aa0d11a8ca3957767d1c58755.poster.avif?t=1769336098\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_it